<section id="section-14-1-conclusion" class="flex flex-col mt-(--spacing-lg) gap-y-(--spacing-sm) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md)"><h2 class="text-(--custom-color-header) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md) [--inline-code-border:] [--inline-code-px:var(--spacing-xs)] [--inline-code-aside-ps:none] [--inline-code-mx:0.1em] break-words font-bold text-4xl mb-sm">Conclusion</h2><p class="">I built a CRUD service, this is what most backends do to power modern Apps and the Web.</p><p class="">In addition I delved deeper into HTTP as the plaintext message-passing protocol that it is, and implemented the four essential methods: <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">GET</code>, <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">POST</code>, <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">PUT</code>, and <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">DELETE</code> that pretty much any App or Web service implement as their business logic.</p><p class="">I look forward to the next task, where I&#x27;ll be replacing the temporary in-memory storage with an actual persistent database.</p><p class="">Have fun with interacting with the live service, and I&#x27;ll be seeing you in the next blog 🙌🏽</p></section>
