<section id="section-2-1-objectives" class="flex flex-col mt-(--spacing-lg) gap-y-(--spacing-sm) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md)"><h2 class="text-(--custom-color-header) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md) [--inline-code-border:] [--inline-code-px:var(--spacing-xs)] [--inline-code-aside-ps:none] [--inline-code-mx:0.1em] break-words font-bold text-4xl mb-sm">Objectives</h2><p class=""><figure class="w-full overflow-hidden mx-auto py-sm flex flex-col items-center gap-y-default"><img class="max-h-[375px] w-full rounded-lg object-contain" src="/delete.jpg" alt="Closeup of index finger pressing the delete key on a keyboard"/><figcaption class="max-w-[60%] font-normal italic text-center text-xs text-(--custom-color-dimmest)">Closeup of index finger pressing the delete key on a keyboard</figcaption></figure></p><ul class="list-outside pl-sm space-y-sm">
<li>We&#x27;ll implement our <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">DELETE</code> request handling Controller (<code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">ts: deleteUser</code> in <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">src/controllers/deleteUser.ts</code>).</li>
<li>Refactor our error handling e.g. Validation or Runtime Errors from the controller to a central <em class="inline-block mx-1">middleware</em> logic.</li>
</ul></section>
